}}'''Jellyfish (Knife)''' is an [[Uncommon Weapons|uncommon]] knife obtainable from opening the [[2024 Summer Box]] during the [[Summer Event 2024]] or through trading. 

== Appearance ==
The blade spots a dark blue coloration, which gradually fades to black in the handle. The knife also has 3 jellyfishes: One on the handle and two on the blade.
==Trivia==
*It partners with its own effect, [[Jellyfish (Effect)|Jellyfish]].
